# The image needs train.py, wheelsai_trainer/ and the requirements files.
# Everything else stays out of the build context: tests, fixtures, docs,
# and above all any environment, cache or model file left by a local run.
*
!train.py
!requirements.txt
!requirements-gpu.txt
!wheelsai_trainer/
!wheelsai_trainer/*.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
